 r←{x}Status y;rc;more;path;⎕TRAP;short;space;ind;branch;msg;cmd;aplNames;verbose;noAplNames;allUntracked
⍝ Reports all unstaged/uncommited/untracked files.\\
⍝ `y` must be one of:
⍝   * Fully qualfied name of a namespace that is an opened Cider project
⍝   * Fully qualified path to a Git-managed project
⍝ `x`, if specified, must be a vector of up to three Booleans: `verbose`, `noAplNames` and
⍝ `allUntracked`
⍝ * `verbose` defaults to 0
⍝   * verbose←1 gives a full report whith headers, usually useful only for the user command
⍝   * verbose←0 returns a matrix with 3 columns:
⍝     [;1] index indicators (one of ADM)
⍝     [;2] working area indicators (one of ADM)
⍝     [;3] the path
⍝ * `noAPLnames` defaults to 0. When set, no fourth column with APL names is returned
⍝ * `allUntracked` defaults to 0. When set, Git lists the files within an untracked folder rather
⍝   than just the folder itself. <CompareCommits> needs this, the user command does not
 ⎕TRAP←(811 'E' '⎕DMX.EM ⎕signal 811')(0 'N')
 x←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0 0 0}'x'
 (verbose noAplNames allUntracked)←x,(≢x)↓0 0 0
 (space path)←EstablishProject y
 cmd←'status',((~verbose)/' --short'),allUntracked/' -uall'
 (rc more r)←path U.RunGitCommand cmd
 more U.Assert 0=rc
 ((≢'fatal:')↓more)U.Assert'fatal:'{⍺≢(≢⍺)↑⍵}more
 :If verbose
     ind←⍸∨/¨'On branch'∘⍷¨r
     :If 0<≢ind                 ⍝ There is no "On branch" line when HEAD is detached
         ind←⊃ind
         branch←⊃¯1↑' '(≠⊆⊢)ind⊃r
         :If (⊂branch)∊'main' 'master'
             msg←∊(⎕UCS 13),U.Box{⍵{(⍵⍴'⌹')⍺(⍵⍴'⌹')}≢⍵}'⌹ On branch ',branch,' ⌹'
         :Else
             msg←'On branch ',branch
         :EndIf
         (ind⊃r)←msg
     :EndIf
     r←⍪(⊂path{0<≢⍵:'Namespace: ',⍵ ⋄ 'Folder: ',⍺}space),⊆r
 :Else
     :If 0<≢r←{(↑2↑¨⍵),3↓¨⍵}⍣(0<≢r)⊢r
     :AndIf ~noAplNames
         r,←space∘GetItemName¨(⊂path,'/'),¨(⊃∘⌽∘HandleRenames)¨r[;3]
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
⍝Done
